meta {
  name: Close All Positions
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/positions/close-all
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  # Close All Positions

  Market-sells every position tracked by the bot and clears the tracker.

  Each close is a MARKET SELL for exactly the held quantity, so the no-short
  guardrail always permits it. A position is removed from the tracker only when
  its SELL is accepted. Recorded in the trade log as strategy "MANUAL_CLOSE_ALL".

  ## Response
  {
    "requested": 2,
    "closed": 2,
    "failed": 0,
    "results": [ { "ticker", "quantity", "success", "orderId", "message" } ],
    "mode": "PAPER",
    "timestamp": "..."
  }

  ## Note
  This is a POST — it places real SELL orders in LIVE mode. In PAPER mode the
  sells are simulated.
}
